Knowledge Base: Connected / Disconnected Satellite - CA Bundle and Hammer ISS Sync
====================================================================================

START HERE
----------
  Audience: Satellite admins running ISS network sync (connected + disconnected).

  Workflow:
    1. Fix TLS trust on CONNECTED (section 1) so remote hammer works
    2. Point hammer at DISCONNECTED with --server (section 2)
    3. List enabled repos on disconnected (section 3)
    4. Sync all those repos on disconnected (section 4)
    5. Use checklist / troubleshooting (sections 5-6) as needed

  Critical reminder:
    Run hammer ON connected Satellite.
    Use --server to TARGET disconnected Satellite.
    Connected must already have synced the same content from the Red Hat CDN.


